          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bomuzi base bethi ku-Elisha: “Bheka, isimo salumuzi sihle, njengokuba inkosi yami ibona, kepha amanzi awalutho, nomhlabathi awubabaleki;",
          "type": "text",
