              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesenyuka esuka lapho waya eBhetheli; kwathi esendleleni, kwaphuma abantwana abancane bomuzi, bamklolodela, bathi kuye: Yenyuka, mpandlandini; khuphuka, khanda elinempandla.",
          "type": "text",
