              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waphenduka wababheka, wabaqalekisa egameni likaJehova. Kwavela amabhere amabili ezinsikazi ehlathini, azala abantwana abangamashumi amane nambili.",
          "type": "text",
